{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["Deluders of spirit asked how Scripture says <b>fathers shall not be put to death</b>, while in another place it says 'punishing the iniquity of fathers upon sons.' Their question is void, for 'fathers shall not be put to death for sons' is a commandment upon Israel, while 'punishing the iniquity of fathers upon sons' refers to Him who punishes. I have already explained it in its place."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:24:39.434112618Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}